    "According to you, how can LLMs be used to innovate math learning in schools and universities?": "LLMs could personalize explanations by adapting step-by-step guidance to student struggles (e.g., for my anxiety-prone extraversion). Use interactive quizzes or ‘math tutors’ for immediate feedback. Visualizations + text could bridge abstract concepts like derivatives—my baking hobby’s visual notes inspire me! Pair with gamified challenges to boost engagement, though ensure human oversight keeps it accurate."
